    "html": "<p>A satellite orbits Earth with orbital radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span>. The centripetal acceleration of the satellite is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span>. What is the centripetal acceleration of the satellite when it is moved to an orbit with radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{R}{3}\"></span>?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{a}{9}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{a}{3}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3a\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"> <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9a\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
